copied from Emil Kowalski's skills repository —
https://github.com/emilkowalski/skills — and remain under his MIT license,
reproduced below. STANDARDS.md (from review-animations/) and AUDIT.md (from
improve-animations/) are verbatim below their provenance headers;
VOCABULARY.md (from animation-vocabulary/SKILL.md) has the upstream YAML
frontmatter removed and is otherwise verbatim.

Legato's prompt files additionally distill guidance from the same
repository's emil-design-eng, apple-design, find-animation-opportunities,
improve-animations, review-animations, and pick-ui-library skills.

This license applies to this directory's copied material only; the rest of
the Repertoire plugin is licensed as stated in the repository root.

